Exclude the whole shared component directory

A clean clone builds with 55 warnings under -W, because sf-shared ships
_shared/component/ with 55 pages this kit never references, and exclude_patterns
only listed individual files from pi_start/ and appendix/.

The local checkout did not show this: its submodule was a sparse checkout holding
only pi_start/ and appendix/, so Sphinx never saw the component tree. Excluding by
directory fixes it, and the README now says to verify in a clean clone.
